# Day 33/60 — AI Media Integrity Analyzer

## Objective

Today I built an AI Media Integrity Analyzer that helps users evaluate news headlines, detect emotional manipulation, analyze bias, and improve media literacy through an interactive dashboard.

The goal is to encourage critical thinking by showing how AI can explain persuasive techniques instead of simply classifying content.

