- Bias Analysis Dashboard
- Media Integrity Metrics
- Interactive News Scenarios
- Live Integrity Score
- Responsive HTML Dashboard

---

## What I Learned

### Headlines Shape Perception

The wording of a headline can significantly influence how readers interpret a story before reading the article itself.

### Emotion Drives Engagement

Many headlines use emotional language to increase clicks and shares. Recognizing these patterns helps reduce misinformation.

### AI Supports Critical Thinking

AI should assist users by explaining why content appears biased or emotionally framed rather than making decisions on their behalf.

### Interactive Learning Improves Awareness

Hands-on simulations make complex concepts like media integrity and cognitive bias much easier to understand.

